// Purpose: Query application telemetry
// Learn: Inspect traces, latency and error signals after telemetry exists.
// Run: Use Azure Portal Application Insights / Log Analytics query editor as described in docs/setup/09_MONITORING.md. Run one query at a time.

// Workspace-based Application Insights. Verify table names in your query context.
AppDependencies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| summarize requests=count(), p95_ms=percentile(DurationMs,95) by Name
| order by p95_ms desc

// Error classes without raw prompt/credential payloads.
AppExceptions
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| summarize count() by ExceptionType
